[node name="Oculus" type="Node3D" parent="."]
editor_description = "Daylight through the glazed crown (marble.glb, r 11, y 79). Sun: straight down, unshadowed, its cone the beam's; Beam: the visible light, additive.\nSpill: two unshadowed omnis on the beam's axis above the tower throwing its light out onto the ring; negative attenuation so the far cells get as much as the tower top."

